  {
   "id": "dustland-delivery-302379@1.20.1021",
   "gameId": "dustland-delivery-302379",
   "displayName": "Update 1.20.1021",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-07T09:02:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Dustlanders!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In this update, we've reworked the sales stall system, alongside a number of other improvements. See below for details:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Stall System",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Now, when you're in a city, you can select \\[Set Up Stall] from the interactions menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44994478/c72658d4643bd7adc6789e363f6f531fd56277a9.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the old system, you would randomly sell food, parts, or equipment taken from your inventory. Now, after choosing the type of product you want to sell, you will enter a new \"Stall\" screen as shown below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44994478/893ea268cc2c42961e802f0a4c7d91596b0fa82a.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "✅ Product types currently available for sale",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cooked food",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Equipment/truck parts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "📈 How to Sell Products",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "When you set up your stall, you must select one member of your crew to be your Salesperson. Choose a character from the panel in the bottom left.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You will attract a certain number of customers with each shift depending on city size, your Salesperson's Speech stat, time of day, and other factors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Choosing \\[Next Shift] will advance time and increase your Salesperson's Stress and Fatigue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Characters with Stress or Fatigue over 90% cannot be your Salesperson.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If no crew members are able to be your Salesperson, your stall will automatically close.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44994478/d0131d23103cc136afc1faad60638a75f306de19.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After setting up your stall, select \\[Next Shift] to attract customers who want to purchase your goods.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each customer will have specific needs, and will grant you corresponding rewards for fulfilling them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The more of a customer's needs a product fulfills, the more they will pay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can check the Customer Queue to see your customers' needs and formulate your sales strategy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You must fulfill at least one of a customer's needs in order to make a sale.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mouse over a product to see how many of the current customer's needs it can fulfill, then click the product to try to sell it to them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added a Continue button to the main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an Urgent Engine Repair feature. Now you can repair your truck's engine even if you are not in a city.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
