      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where map mouse zoom was still possible when the Store interface pops up in Caravan events.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where characters with the Robot trait could use Medkits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can now close the Store interface using hotkeys in Caravan events.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a feature that allows you to use Medkits stored in your city to heal characters during combat in player-owned cities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved sequencing for the Sheol main story, adding details in text.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the food consumption interface, adding reminders to indicate when a character is Infected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved interactions in volcano areas, adding an option to obtain Survey Data.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finally, although we came a tiny bit short of our wishlist target for the Sheol DLC, we couldn't help it—the Steam Points Shop rewards were too awesome to keep to ourselves!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "So to thank you for your support... all Steam Points Shop rewards will be released in full! They'll be available very soon, so keep an eye out for future announcements!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
