  {
   "id": "dustland-delivery-302379@1.20.937",
   "gameId": "dustland-delivery-302379",
   "displayName": "Update 1.20.937",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-14T09:06:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Dustlanders!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "See below for notes on the latest update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "◈ Update Version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v1.20.937",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "◈ Update Details",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the contracts interface. Tasks where you must provide the goods yourself are now clearly marked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the cooking interface, adding a new 'save recipe' feature. Saved recipes will be shown at the top of the list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a notification text issue when buying goods.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed known image layering issues in player-owned cities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're so thankful for all the support you've shown us since we announced our new Sheol DLC!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Sheol DLC contains a ton of new storylines to discover, locations to explore, and challenges to conquer. If you think it's worth it and would like to support us, we'd appreciate you checking it out!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If enough Dustlanders wishlist the DLC, you'll unlock custom Discord emojis, Steam Points Shop avatar frames, and more! Learn More: New DLC Coming April 2! Wishlist Now for Community Rewards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Of course, we'll also continue refining the game, incorporating your feedback, and delivering a weird and wild Dustlands.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you to all the Dustlanders who've rode shotgun with us on this lonesome desert road. Your support is what's allowed us to keep on trucking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To show our love for our amazing community, we're launching a special \"Mysteries of Sheol\" event. Ready to take on an important new mission? Check out the event post via the link below and leave a comment!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
