  {
   "id": "dustland-delivery-302379@1.20.907",
   "gameId": "dustland-delivery-302379",
   "displayName": "Update 1.20.907",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-28T10:05:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Dustlanders!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "See below for notes on the latest update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "◈ Update Version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v1.20.907",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "◈ Details",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed an issue where truck Horsepower would be calculated incorrectly in certain circumstances.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Added a detailed mouseover tooltip on the speedometer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Improved the display of Horsepower and Speed, making it clearer to understand the factors affecting the truck's movement speed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Improved text descriptions for certain features.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'd also like to make an announcement on the progress of the new DLC:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Currently, everything is going to plan. However, the DLC is particularly large, with two new interconnected maps, a new main storyline, multiple side stories, and all-new ruins exploration gameplay. In order to ensure you have the best possible gameplay experience, our current plan is to release the DLC in April. In the meantime, we'll continue to work on improving the game and quality assurance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for waiting. We'll be holding community events to reward you for your patience, so stay tuned for future announcements!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
