  {
   "id": "dustland-delivery-302379@1.20.877",
   "gameId": "dustland-delivery-302379",
   "displayName": "Update 1.20.877",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-17T09:43:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Dustlanders! See below for details on update v1.20.877:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Redesigned Apartments. More interactions are now available for Apartments in player-owned cities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Adjusted the truck engine temperature mechanism.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Improved map interface UI.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Improved trade summary text.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Improved Repair Shops in cities. You can now cool your engine at Repair Shops.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fixed issues with certain icons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fixed an issue where icons would appear in the wrong places in the combat interface under certain circumstances.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Vacation Announcement",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for your ongoing support! Since we entered Early Access last July, Dustland Delivery has seen updates almost every week.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After this update, the dev team will take a break for the Lunar New Year. Once the break is over, we'll come back refreshed and ready to keep making Dustland Delivery the best it can be.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "During this break, we'll continue to gather suggestions and feedback from the community. If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to raise them with us on our community pages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "About the New DLC",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're also working hard to prepare for the next phase of the game's development—brand new DLC is scheduled for release around February/March.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new DLC will include 2 new interconnected maps, an all-new main story and side stories, and a new ruins exploration feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please keep an eye out for future announcements!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for supporting Dustland Delivery. Your feedback, suggestions, and ongoing support are what drive us on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We wish you safe travels and wondrous adventures on the road ahead.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dustland Delivery Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
